,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"为 AI agent 统一管理代码仓库克隆路径（默认 ~/.x-repo/<provider>/<owner>/<name>，跨 agent 共享）"
,
"en"
:
"Unify code repository clone paths for AI agents (default ~/.x-repo/<provider>/<owner>/<name>, shared across agents)"
}
,
"#meta"
:
{
"default-subcmd"
:
"ls"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"除非用户另行指定或已有惯例，新克隆均按默认布局放置——便于多 agent 复用、`x repo` 发现，以及后续同步与共享缓存加速。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Unless the user specifies otherwise or an existing convention applies, place new clones under the default layout — enabling cross-agent reuse, `x repo` discoverability, and future sync / shared cache acceleration.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"不带格式选项时，交互终端以 csv app 浏览，管道或重定向则以 TSV 输出。"
,
"en"
:
"Without format flag, interactive terminal opens csv app; pipe or redirect outputs TSV."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"打开 tmux：`x repo t <id>` 或 `x tmux repo <id>`，session 名按 `<provider>/<owner>/<name>` 命名（github.com→gh, codeberg.org→cb, gitlab.com→gl, gitee.com→gt, bitbucket.org→bb）。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Open in tmux: `x repo t <id>` or `x tmux repo <id>`. The session is named `<provider>/<owner>/<name>` (github.com→gh, codeberg.org→cb, gitlab.com→gl, gitee.com→gt, bitbucket.org→bb).\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo x-bash/repo"
,
"cn"
:
"默认: 解析后 cd 进本地仓库；不存在则 update 克隆"
,
"en"
:
"Default: resolve then cd into the local repo; update-clones if missing"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo ls"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 列出所有已克隆的仓库"
,
"en"
:
"Example: list all cloned repositories"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo ls --raw"
,
"cn"
:
"原始路径: provider/org/repo 格式，适合脚本处理"
,
"en"
:
"Raw paths: provider/org/repo format, suitable for scripting"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo ls --tsv"
,
"cn"
:
"TSV 格式: 带表头，适合管道和 awk 处理"
,
"en"
:
"TSV format: with headers, suitable for piping and awk"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo ls --csv"
,
"cn"
:
"CSV 格式: 适合表格软件和数据库导入"
,
"en"
:
"CSV format: suitable for spreadsheets and database import"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo which sh/re"
,
"cn"
:
"解析 owner/name 为本地路径 (owner 含 sh, name 含 re)"
,
"en"
:
"Resolve owner/name to the local path (owner contains sh, name contains re)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo which /sh/re"
,
"cn"
:
"which 的模糊模式: 前缀 / 走 fuzzywhich 解析"
,
"en"
:
"which in fuzzy mode: a leading / routes through fuzzywhich"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo which x-bash/repo@feat~auth"
,
"cn"
:
"which 的 wt 模式: @<wtname> 直接解析到对应 worktree 路径（wtname 可以是 branch / tag / SHA / agent 名 / issue id）"
,
"en"
:
"which in wt mode: @<wtname> resolves directly to the worktree path (wtname can be branch / tag / SHA / agent name / issue id)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo cd x-bash/repo"
,
"cn"
:
"显式 cd: 与默认 x repo <name> 等价"
,
"en"
:
"Explicit cd: equivalent to the default x repo <name>"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo fe x-bash/repo"
,
"cn"
:
"fresh 简写 (fe): 解析后用 fresh 编辑器打开"
,
"en"
:
"shortcut for fresh: resolve then open in the fresh editor"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo c x-bash/repo"
,
"cn"
:
"code 简写 (c): 解析后用 vscode 打开; 不存在则 update 克隆"
,
"en"
:
"shortcut for code: resolve then open in vscode; update-clones if missing"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo t x-bash/repo"
,
"cn"
:
"tmux 简写 (t): 打开（或新建）session :gh/x-bash/repo"
,
"en"
:
"shortcut for tmux: open (or create) session :gh/x-bash/repo"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo update x-bash/repo x-bash/brew"
,
"cn"
:
"批量: 对每个 id 解析后 clone 或 update 一次"
,
"en"
:
"Batch: resolve each id and clone-or-update in turn"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo prepare x-bash/repo x-bash/wsl"
,
"cn"
:
"多仓工作面准备: 每个 id clone 或 update 一次，并打印解析路径供 ../<sibling> 引用"
,
"en"
:
"Multi-repo workspace setup: clone-or-update each id and print resolved paths for ../<sibling> references"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo card x-cmd/install"
,
"cn"
:
"仓库评分卡: 1 次 GraphQL（合并 16 个 search 计数）+ 1 次 REST /stats/commit_activity，输出 about/timeline/popularity/language/recent 五段，全程 API 不碰本地 clone"
,
"en"
:
"Repo scorecard: 1 GraphQL (carrying 16 aliased search counts) + 1 REST /stats/commit_activity, emits about/timeline/popularity/language/recent sections, fully API-driven — no local clone touched"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo wt x-bash/repo feat/auth"
,
"cn"
:
"默认形式: 在 feat/auth 分支上创建或 attach worktree（分支不存在则从 HEAD 新建，存在则 attach）"
,
"en"
:
"Default form: create-or-attach a worktree on branch feat/auth (new branch from HEAD if absent, attaches otherwise)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo wt ls x-bash/repo"
,
"cn"
:
"列出该仓库的所有 worktree（裸库 + 默认 wt + 额外的 wt）"
,
"en"
:
"List all worktrees of the repo (bare + default wt + extras)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo wt rm x-bash/repo feat/auth"
,
"cn"
:
"优雅删除 worktree（走 git worktree remove，bare 的 worktrees/ 登记表同步更新）"
,
"en"
:
"Graceful remove (git worktree remove; bare's worktrees/ registry stays in sync)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo which x-bash/repo@feat~auth"
,
"cn"
:
"复盘 wt 路径: x repo which <id>@<wtname> 直接解析到对应 worktree"
,
"en"
:
"Reuse a wt path: x repo which <id>@<wtname> resolves directly to the worktree"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:common"
:
[
"ls"
,
"which"
,
"cd"
,
"fresh"
,
"code"
,
"tmux"
,
"prepare"
,
"update"
,
"card"
,
"wt"
]
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列出所有已克隆的代码仓库"
,
"en"
:
"List all cloned code repositories"
}
,
"--raw"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"原始路径输出（provider/org/repo）"
,
"en"
:
"Raw path output (provider/org/repo)"
}
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"TSV 表格格式输出（provider, owner, name, filepath）"
,
"en"
:
"TSV table format output (provider, owner, name, filepath)"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"CSV 表格格式输出"
,
"en"
:
"CSV table format output"
}
}
,
"--app"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"交互式 csv app 浏览"
,
"en"
:
"Interactive csv app browser"
}
}
,
"--auto"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"自动模式（TTY→app, 管道→tsv）"
,
"en"
:
"Auto mode (TTY→app, pipe→tsv)"
}
}
}
,
"which"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"将 owner/name 或 provider/owner/name 解析为本地克隆路径（前缀 / 走 fuzzywhich 模糊匹配）"
,
"en"
:
"Resolve owner/name or provider/owner/name to a local clone path (a leading / uses fuzzywhich for fuzzy matching)"
}
,
"owner/name"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"owner 与 name 可分别给出子串；任一为空视为通配。例如 which sh/re 命中 x-bash/re。支持 github.com/gh/codeberg.org/cb/gitlab.com/gl/gitee.com/gt/bitbucket.org/bb 前缀。"
,
"en"
:
"owner and name are independent substrings; an empty part is a wildcard. e.g. which sh/re matches x-bash/re. Supports github.com/gh/codeberg.org/cb/gitlab.com/gl/gitee.com/gt/bitbucket.org/bb prefixes."
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 which 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show which help"
}
}
}
,
"cd"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"解析后 cd 进本地仓库路径（不存在则 update 克隆再 cd）"
,
"en"
:
"Resolve then cd into the local repo path (update-clones if missing)"
}
,
"owner/name"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"接受 / 前缀的模糊解析，例如 cd /x-bash/re"
,
"en"
:
"Accepts a /-prefixed fuzzy query, e.g. cd /x-bash/re"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 cd 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show cd help"
}
}
}
,
"fresh"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"解析后用 fresh 编辑器打开本地仓库"
,
"en"
:
"Resolve then open the local repo in the fresh editor"
}
,
"owner/name"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"解析失败则报错；调用方负责先 update 克隆（参见 x repo update）"
,
"en"
:
"Fails if the repo can't be resolved; caller is responsible for cloning first (see x repo update)"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 fresh 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show fresh help"
}
}
}
,
"code"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"解析后用 vscode 打开本地仓库（不存在则 update 克隆再打开）"
,
"en"
:
"Resolve then open the local repo in vscode (update-clones if missing)"
}
,
"owner/name"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"支持 / 前缀的模糊解析，例如 code /x-bash/re"
,
"en"
:
"Accepts a /-prefixed fuzzy query, e.g. code /x-bash/re"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 code 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show code help"
}
}
}
,
"tmux"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"解析后打开 tmux session（命名规则与 x tmux repo 一致，见 tip）"
,
"en"
:
"Resolve then open a tmux session (naming follows x tmux repo; see tip)"
}
,
"owner/name"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"浅包装：等价于 x tmux repo <id>；session 名由 tmux 模块决定"
,
"en"
:
"Shallow wrapper: equivalent to x tmux repo <id>; the tmux module owns the session name"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 tmux 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show tmux help"
}
}
}
,
"update"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"解析每个 id；本地存在则 update，不存在则 clone；接受多个 id"
,
"en"
:
"Resolve each id; update if a local clone exists, otherwise clone; accepts multiple ids"
}
,
"id..."
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"可一次给多个 id（如 update x-bash/repo x-bash/brew），逐个处理。支持 github.com/gh/codeberg.org/cb/gitlab.com/gl/gitee.com/gt/bitbucket.org/bb 前缀。"
,
"en"
:
"Pass multiple ids at once (e.g. update x-bash/repo x-bash/brew) to process them in order. Supports github.com/gh/codeberg.org/cb/gitlab.com/gl/gitee.com/gt/bitbucket.org/bb prefixes."
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 update 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show update help"
}
}
}
,
"prepare"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"为多仓协作准备本地工作面；每个 id clone 或 update 一次，并打印解析路径"
,
"en"
:
"Prepare a multi-repo local workspace; clone-or-update each id and print resolved paths"
}
,
"id..."
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"每个 id 经 update_one 处理；输出每行一个解析后的主路径，供 ../<sibling> 引用"
,
"en"
:
"Each id goes through update_one; output is one resolved main path per line, ready for ../<sibling> references"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 prepare 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show prepare help"
}
}
}
,
"card"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"为仓库生成评分卡：1 次 GraphQL（合并 16 个 search 计数）+ 1 次 REST /stats/commit_activity，默认 --auto（TTY 表格 / 管道 YAML），全程 API，不碰本地 clone"
,
"en"
:
"Emit a repo scorecard: 1 GraphQL (carrying 16 aliased search counts) + 1 REST /stats/commit_activity, default --auto (TTY table / pipe YAML), API-only, no local clone touched"
}
,
"id"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id（如 x-cmd/install）；接受 owner/repo、gh/owner/repo、github.com/owner/repo；末尾 @wtname 会被剥离"
,
"en"
:
"Repo id (e.g. x-cmd/install); accepts owner/repo, gh/owner/repo, github.com/owner/repo; trailing @wtname is stripped"
}
}
,
"--days"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"自定义第二个统计窗口在输出中的标签天数（默认 90，即显示为 last90d；仅改标签名，不改实际统计截止日）"
,
"en"
:
"Customize the day label of the second stats window (default 90, shown as last90d; only changes the label, not the actual cutoff date)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"要显示的天数，例如 90、180"
,
"en"
:
"Day count to display, e.g. 90 or 180"
}
}
}
,
"--tty"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"强制以彩色表格形式输出"
,
"en"
:
"Force colored table output"
}
}
,
"--yml"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"强制输出裸 YAML"
,
"en"
:
"Force raw YAML output"
}
}
,
"--auto"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"自动选择输出格式（默认；TTY 走 --tty，管道/重定向走 --yml）"
,
"en"
:
"Auto-select output format (default; TTY -> --tty, pipe/redirect -> --yml)"
}
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"不再触碰本地 clone：head / lastCommit / commit 数 全部走 GitHub API，仓库还没 clone 时也能直接跑，不用先 `x repo <id>` 拉一份到本地。\n"
,
"en"
:
"No local clone dependency: head / lastCommit / commit counts all come from the GitHub API, so the card runs on repos you haven't cloned yet — no need to `x repo <id>` first.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"管道/重定向输出为 YAML；YAML 1.2 是 JSON 的超集（对这些标量字段而言），下游按字段抽取可以走 `yq`：例如 `x repo card x-cmd/install | yq '.popularity'`。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Pipe/redirect output is raw YAML; YAML 1.2 is a JSON superset for these scalar fields, so downstream extraction via `yq` works: e.g. `x repo card x-cmd/install | yq '.popularity'`.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"YAML 分段：`about:`（描述 / license / homepage / head / latest ver / 采集时刻）、`timeline:`（创建 / 最后提交 / 最后发布日）、`popularity:`（star / watcher / fork / release / contributor / pullRequest / issue）、`language:` + `totalLine`（linguist 字节构成）、`recent:`（四个窗口 last30d/90d/180d/360d 的合并 PR / open PR / closed issue / open issue / release / commit 计数）。\n"
,
"en"
:
"YAML sections: `about:` (description / license / homepage / head / latest ver / collected-at), `timeline:` (created / last commit / last release date), `popularity:` (star / watcher / fork / release / contributor / pullRequest / issue), `language:` + `totalLine` (linguist bytes), `recent:` (merged PR / open PR / closed issue / open issue / release / commit counts over last 30d / 90d / 180d / 360d windows).\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"**GitHub 认证**：card 需要 token 才能稳（未鉴权时 GraphQL 降到 60 req/h）。优先 `gh auth login` 后由 `gh auth token` 提供；也可设置 `$GH_TOKEN` 或 `$GITHUB_TOKEN`。\n"
,
"en"
:
"**GitHub auth**: card needs a token to be reliable (anonymous GraphQL caps at 60 req/h). Token resolution order: `gh auth token`, then `$GH_TOKEN`, then `$GITHUB_TOKEN`.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo card jqlang/jq"
,
"cn"
:
"基本用法: 默认 --auto，TTY 输出彩色表格，管道/重定向输出 YAML（4 个固定窗口）"
,
"en"
:
"Basic: default --auto renders a colored table on TTY, YAML on pipe/redirect (4 fixed windows)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo card x-cmd/install | yq '.popularity'"
,
"cn"
:
"抽取 popularity 段: yq 拿结构化数据"
,
"en"
:
"Extract the popularity section via yq"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo card --yml x-cmd/install > card.yml"
,
"cn"
:
"YAML 文件落地: --yml 锁定裸 YAML，重定向到文件供后续工具消费"
,
"en"
:
"Persist as YAML: --yml locks raw output, redirect to a file for downstream tooling"
}
]
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 card 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show card help"
}
}
}
,
"init"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"把空裸库推进到 initialized 状态：scaffold 一份最小 README，commit 后 push 到 main，再 attach 默认 wt"
,
"en"
:
"Push an empty bare from uninitialized to initialized: scaffold a minimal README, commit, push to main, then attach the default worktree"
}
,
"id"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id（如 x-bash/repo）；裸库不存在则先 clone --bare"
,
"en"
:
"Repo id (e.g. x-bash/repo); clones the bare first if it doesn't exist"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 init 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show init help"
}
}
}
,
"wt"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"管理 worktree：创建或 attach（默认）、显式 create、列出（ls）、删除（rm）；仅做 worktree 层面的包装，不参与 git fetch/merge"
,
"en"
:
"Manage worktrees: create-or-attach (default), explicit create, list (ls), remove (rm); a thin worktree-only wrapper, does not fetch or merge"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x repo wt <id> <branch>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x repo wt create <id> <branch>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x repo wt ls <id>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x repo wt rm <id> <branch>"
:
null
}
]
,
"#subcmd:wt"
:
[
"create"
,
"ls"
,
"rm"
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo wt x-bash/repo feat/auth"
,
"cn"
:
"默认: 在 feat/auth 上创建或 attach（缺则从 HEAD 新建，存在则 attach）"
,
"en"
:
"Default: create-or-attach on feat/auth (new branch from HEAD if absent, attaches otherwise)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo wt ls x-bash/repo"
,
"cn"
:
"列出 worktree: 裸库 + 默认 wt + 额外的 wt"
,
"en"
:
"List worktrees: bare + default wt + extras"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo wt rm x-bash/repo feat/auth"
,
"cn"
:
"优雅删除: git worktree remove；不要手动 rm -rf"
,
"en"
:
"Graceful remove via git worktree remove; never rm -rf directly"
}
]
,
"create"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"为 <id> 在 <branch> 上创建 worktree（显式 create）；等价于默认形式 x repo wt <id> <branch>"
,
"en"
:
"Create a worktree for <id> on <branch> (explicit form); equivalent to the default x repo wt <id> <branch>"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id，可带 / 前缀走 fuzzywhich"
,
"en"
:
"Repository id; accepts /-prefixed fuzzy query"
}
}
,
"#2"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"要在其上创建或 attach worktree 的分支名；缺则从 HEAD 新建，存在则 attach"
,
"en"
:
"Branch on which to create or attach the worktree; created from HEAD if absent, attached otherwise"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 create 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show create help"
}
}
}
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列出 <id> 仓库的所有 worktree（裸库 + 默认 wt + 额外的 wt；裸库自己不出现在 git worktree list 里）"
,
"en"
:
"List all worktrees of <id> (bare + default wt + extras; the bare itself is not in git worktree list)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id，可带 / 前缀走 fuzzywhich"
,
"en"
:
"Repository id; accepts /-prefixed fuzzy query"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 ls 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show ls help"
}
}
}
,
"rm"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"优雅删除 <id> 上名为 <branch> 的 worktree；走 git worktree remove，bare 的 worktrees/ 登记表自动同步；不要手动 rm -rf"
,
"en"
:
"Graceful remove of the worktree for <branch> on <id>; uses git worktree remove and syncs bare's worktrees/ registry; never rm -rf directly"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id，可带 / 前缀走 fuzzywhich"
,
"en"
:
"Repository id; accepts /-prefixed fuzzy query"
}
}
,
"#2"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"要删除的 worktree 对应分支名；必须对应已 attach 的 worktree，否则 git 报错"
,
"en"
:
"Branch name of the worktree to remove; must match an attached worktree, otherwise git errors"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 rm 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show rm help"
}
}
}
}
}

